    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "It takes Clara 4 days to paint a house and Dana takes 6 days to paint a house. How long will it take Clara and Dana to paint the house if they work together?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{12}{5}$ days",
      "worked": "In 12 days, Clara can paint 3 houses and Dana can paint 2 houses. Together they can paint 5 houses in 12 days.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Time for one house}&=\\frac{12}{3+2}\\\\\\text{Time for one house}&=\\frac{12}{5}\\text{ days}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
